OL,3,ATapestry tour added for blind after
OL,4,Alegal threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Museum says it will provide
OL,7,Fan audio-described tour of the Bayeux
OL,8,FTapestry after a blind man threatened
OL,9,Flegal action over a lack of access for
OL,10,Fvisually impaired visitors.
OL,12,FDr Yusuf Ali Osman, from Croydon, says
OL,13,Fthe museum breached the Equality Act by
OL,14,Fnot offering such tours of the
OL,15,Fexhibition.
OL,17,FHis lawyers, Leigh Day, sent the museum
OL,18,Fa pre-action letter on 24 September.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
