OL,3,ATapestry tour added for blind after
OL,4,Alegal threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the central London museum
OL,7,Fsaid an in-person audio-described tour
OL,8,Fwould be held during the exhibition's
OL,9,Frun. It said it was also exploring
OL,10,Fadding an audio-described tour to the
OL,11,Fexhibition's app.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
